	(text_box "Transformer supply: F1001 backup fuse, L1001 filter, TPS25982 eFuse (VTRANS_EN, soft start, 13 A circuit breaker, 4 retries then latch-off)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(size 243.37 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8c79f8c0-6572-5fdf-9be2-ec3daa88c08e")
	)
	(text_box "VBAT_SYS -> F1001 (backup if the eFuse fails short) -> L1001 1 uH -> eFuse IN -> eFuse OUT = VTRANS -> bulk. The inductor sits BEFORE the eFuse, so the eFuse carries only the filtered battery current (about 10 A\nmaximum) and its output sees only capacitors (no negative inductive kick at turn-off). The 21-23 A primary peaks come from the bulk capacitors.\nILIM 113 Ohm: 1460/113 + 0.11 = 13.0 A nominal, about 11.4-14.5 A over temperature (datasheet rows scaled). Fast trip 2.1 x ILIM within 400 ns. Circuit-breaker variant: overload beyond ITIMER (470 pF: 0.11-0.48 ms)\nturns the FET off. RETRY_DLY 2.2 nF + NRETRY open: 4 automatic retries 92 ms apart, then latch-off (a nuisance trip heals itself; a real short ends latched after about 0.4 s). The latch resets only with VTRANS_EN\nlow (< 0.8 V): firmware lowering CHG_SESSION, or HOLD_OK loss.\ndVdt 2.2 nF: 4600/2200 = 2.1 V/ms (0.8-3.2 V/ms with the dVdt current tolerance) -> inrush 0.6-2.3 A into about 720 uF; VTRANS reaches 8.4 V in 2.6-10 ms.\nOVLO 16.9 V variant: harmless extra cut-off far above the 8.4 V pack. EN abs max 7 V: VTRANS_EN is 5 V logic. D1005 limits the input spike when the eFuse opens against the inductor current (1 uH x 13 A^2 / 2 = 85 uJ\ninto 20 uF: +4 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 31.75 0)
		(size 243.37 19.272)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b4ac7096-9bf2-55d0-9123-7422878c29bc")
	)
	(text_box "VTRANS bulk: 4 x 22 uF X7R + 2 x 330 uF polymer (carry the 7.2 A RMS ripple of the primary)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 289.09 25.4 0)
		(size 166.43 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2ac083ce-be21-533b-862e-7088aa7661fe")
	)
	(text_box "Primary current at full charge: 21-23 A peaks, 9-10 A average, 11-12.4 A RMS -> 6.7-7.2 A RMS ripple, about 27-43 kHz (capture notes §4). The\npolymers carry most of the fundamental; the ceramics carry the edges. Place at the transformer primary and switch, smallest loop (LT3751 layout\nitem 3)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 289.09 31.75 0)
		(size 166.43 8.477)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "31b42d45-3db0-5e0b-8612-96545cc3c354")
	)
	(text_box "VTRANS_GOOD: TLV3012B (1.242 V reference) rises at 4.99-5.29 V, falls at 4.76-5.07 V; then >= 1 ms delay; AND CHARGE_EN -> CHARGE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 475.84 25.4 0)
		(size 233.835 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "676eaa96-ef71-55fe-8978-db6ef8729af8")
	)
	(text_box "R-5: CHARGE must not rise before VTRANS is above the LT3751 UVLO1 band (4.58-4.85 V, see the controller box), or the part latches FAULT. Comparator: IN+ = VTRANS x 100k/(309k+100k) with 7.68M positive\nfeedback from OUT; IN- = REF. Rising = 1.242 x 4.130 = 5.13 V nominal, falling 4.93 V nominal (hysteresis 0.20 V at a 5.0 V output swing).\nDelay: 100k + 22 nF into a Schmitt input of U1004 (VT+ 2.39-3.04 V at 5 V) = 1.27-2.29 ms after VTRANS is good; D1006 empties the capacitor at once when VTRANS drops.\nU1004 SN74LVC1G97 wired as a 2-input AND with Schmitt inputs: TI function Y = C'.B + C.A; B (pin 1) = GND gives Y = A.C = CHARGE_EN AND VTRANS-good-delayed. Push-pull everywhere: an open comparator, open\ndelay node or open gate input is pulled low (R11). R1011 holds CHARGE low if U1004's output is open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 475.84 31.75 0)
		(size 233.835 12.795)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7d7d3410-3e6a-5185-99c7-b00d6a9079bc")
	)
	(text_box "LT3751IUFD controller: charge mode (adult), UVLO/OVLO, RVTRANS/RVOUT/RDCM/RBG, DONE and FAULT to the main controller"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 174.212 0)
		(size 255.275 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
