				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f26a517e-4dca-5229-a608-b8b924706aa9")
	)
	(text_box "VCC = 5V0_SYS; LVGATE tied to HVGATE (VCC <= 8 V, datasheet Note 8); CLAMP to VCC (5.6 V gate clamp; the gate swings to VCC with LVGATE active).\nLockouts (V = 1.225 V + 50 uA x R; pin threshold 1.195-1.255 V, pin current 48.5-51.5 uA): UVLO1 69.8k -> VTRANS 4.58/4.72/4.85 V; OVLO1 154k -> 8.66/8.93/9.19 V; UVLO2 71.5k -> VCC 4.66/4.80/4.94 V; OVLO2 87.6k ->\n5.44/5.61/5.77 V. 470 pF on each pin (datasheet: 100 pF-1 nF against false trips).\nPrimary-side output trip (VOUT comparator), v0.3 LAST-RESORT layer L3 (rev3 E-1, D-65): Vout + drops = 0.98 x N x RVOUT/RBG = 0.98 x 50 x 40.2k/876 = 2,249 V sensed; true capacitor volts = sensed minus the rectifier, R1004 and\nwinding drops (19-48 V). Band 2,116-2,316 V true, 2,409 V with the comparator's maximum overdrive (datasheet 40 mV at 2 us): never below the 2,008.6 V window top (107 V), always inside the capacitor's 2,420 V surge rating (11\nV at the very top). Nominal ~2,215 V is ABOVE the 2,200 V continuous rating by design: the latching OVP comparator (sheet 08, 2,073-2,142 V) and the firmware limit act first; this trip only matters if both have failed. RVTRANS\n= RVOUT = 40.2k, RDCM = 18.2k (= 0.45 x RVTRANS; datasheet Table 2 row for VTRANS 5-80 V), all 0.1 %. Keep RVOUT/RDCM/RVTRANS nodes short with no plane underneath (datasheet layout items 4).\nDONE and FAULT are latched open collectors; both pulse low for microseconds at every CHARGE rise. 10k + 1 nF (10 us) filters that pulse (datasheet: 5-20 us RC); the pull-ups (100k to 3V3_MAIN) are on 04."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 180.562 0)
		(size 255.275 19.272)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ffafa312-e8f8-5c04-b92e-e96d2ab3dccb")
	)
	(text_box "Primary power stage: 2 x BSC070N10LS5 in parallel, 5 mOhm Kelvin sense (21.2 A peak), RC snubber, diode + 45 V TVS clamp"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300.995 179.165 0)
		(size 260.56 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
