				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "54fc88c3-f001-560a-ab01-73056a0f9025")
	)
	(text_box "Current limit 106 mV (100-112) / 5 mOhm = 21.2 A (19.8-22.9 A incl. 1 % resistor and 180 ns delay at 8.4 V). Switch drain: VTRANS (<= 8.4 V) + reflected (Vout + drops)/50 (<= 46.7 V at the v0.3 trip top, 48.5 V with maximum\noverdrive: above the SMCJ45A's 45 V standoff, below its 50 V minimum breakdown; simulated extra clamp loss <= 16 uJ/cycle, sim/rev3-wpe) + leakage spike clamped by D1003 + D1004 (SMCJ45A: VBR >= 50 V, about 75 V at 23 A) -> about\n90 V peak against 100 V (and EAS 55 mJ avalanche rating as backup).\nTwo FETs share the 12.4 A RMS: about 0.5 W each in conduction at 4.5-5 V gate (8.5 mOhm max at 25 C, x1.55 hot). Individual 2.2 Ohm gate resistors; 10k gate-source resistors keep the FETs off if 5V0_SYS is absent while VTRANS is\npresent.\nSnubber across the primary 10 Ohm + 1 nF (tau 10 ns < 1 us, datasheet). The sense resistor is Kelvin-connected: CSP and CSN are dedicated traces to its sense pads (datasheet layout)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300.995 185.515 0)
		(size 260.56 14.954)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0126bff4-a9d9-54e5-9257-b6fef3311c45")
	)
	(text_box "HIGH VOLTAGE secondary: T1001 1:50 (made to order), D1001 + D1002 UX-F5B in series (each blocks the full voltage, R-15), R1004 fusible -> HV_CAP_P"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300.995 290.639 0)
		(size 250.28 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
