			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a3089cdd-8a37-50a0-84a6-973038f0b246")
	)
	(text_box "Child-mode voltage ceiling (D-60): FB divider 14 x 2.87 MOhm + 36.9 kOhm (0.1 %), grounded by Q1003 || Q1004 unless MODE_CHILD_HW is high; readback MODE_HW_RB_N"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 347.884 0)
		(size 273.8 5.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "46207b1d-d692-5d16-a501-38919ea4be9e")
	)
	(text_box "Adult and default: Q1003 and Q1004 on, FB about 0 V -> charge mode (the LT3751 runs until CHARGE falls or the VOUT comparator trips). Child: MODE_CHILD_HW high -> U1005 drives FB_GATE low -> both FETs off -> FB = Vout/1,089.9 -> hand-over to\nregulation >= 1,206 V, regulation 1,282-1,365 V, no-load stop <= 1,507 V.\nFail direction: MODE_CHILD_HW open or unpowered -> R1042 pulls it low -> FB_GATE high -> adult; U1005 output open -> R1043 pulls FB_GATE high -> adult. One FET open -> the other still grounds FB (adult kept; this is why there are two). U1005\noutput stuck low -> child ceiling in the adult position, seen on MODE_HW_RB_N (U1006 open drain follows FB_GATE: low = child ceiling active). Either FET shorted = adult ceiling always (design fault 36, not read back).\nTop string: 14 x TNPV1210 2.87 MOhm 0.1 % 25 ppm/K thin film (the contract's 4.02 MOhm 0.1 % thin film is not made: Vishay TNPV tops out at 3.01 MOhm) -> 40.18 MOhm, ratio 1,089.9 vs the design's 1,090.4. (Contract issue 3 §8 and design v0.3\n§B4.3 still name 10 x 4.02 MOhm: WP-E C4 stays open as a documentation change.) 157 V and 8.6 mW per element at 2,200 V (part rated 1,000 V). Every node HV_FB_n is class HV. CHG_FB is low voltage but its creepage to HV_FB_13 must follow the\nin-string rule (0.6 mm + 0.005 mm/V).\nC1024 2.2 nF on FB (datasheet: small capacitor FB to ground lowers injected ripple) gives tau 81 us with the 36.9k."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 354.234 0)
		(size 273.8 19.272)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
