		(property "Description" "Flyback transformer (v0.3 requirement, §B4.5): 1:50 +-1 % (load-bearing: sets the primary-trip band); Lpri 7.5 uH +10 %/-5 % (7.125-8.25 uH); efficiency >= 90 % (core + AC winding loss <= 10 % of throughput) at 20 A peak, 30-45 kHz; primary 12.4 A RMS; secondary winding resistance stated by the maker (design assumes <= 20 Ohm); <= 10 % L loss at 25 A 70 C; leakage <= 1 % Lpri; Csec <= 15 pF; >= 2,200 V DC working; terminals as defined by the symbol"
